			"notes": "## VulkanMod Compatibility\n\nFPSBoost now auto-detects VulkanMod at startup.\n\n**With Vulkan:**\n- Sky/weather/cloud skip → disabled (VulkanMod owns those render passes)\n- Light texture throttle → disabled (Vulkan manages GPU uploads)\n- Config screen shows **Vulkan Mode** indicator\n- Entity culling, LOD, shadow skip, nametag skip, particle cap, block entity culling → **all still active**\n\n**Without Vulkan:** everything runs as normal.\n\nK = menu, J = toggle all on/off"
		},
