			"notes": "**Root cause found from crash log:**\n`java.lang.IllegalStateException: Can only blur once per frame`\n\nIn MC 1.21.11 the screen rendering framework automatically calls `renderBackground()` before your `render()` method. Calling it again inside `render()` triggered a double-blur and crashed.\n\n**Fix:** Removed the `renderBackground()` call from our render override. One line.\n\nAll v5 optimizations are back. Press K to open config (2 pages, MAX FPS PRESET on page 2)."
		},
